The Legend of Edgar

Cursor left, right  walk
Cursor up, down  move lifts
Space  jump
Left Ctrl  attack
Left Alt  block with the shield
A  use the chosen item
C  talk, use, pull
Z  inventory
Comma, full stop  previous, next item
Esc  main menu
F10  screenshot
Right Amiga + F2 (F12)  window or full screen
